Vendored libraries for reading on the device (P-11, P-13)
==========================================================

Served by this app, never from a CDN. Each file is byte-for-byte what the npm
registry published; SHA256SUMS lists them and ClientVendorAssetsTest checks it.
Paths carry the version, so a file never changes under a name — the service
worker caches /app/vendor in a cache of its own (sw.js, VENDOR).

