Sizes, as served: pdf.js 1.8 MB (loaded only when a statement is opened);
tesseract 5.8 MB, of which the core is 2.9 MB and the model 2.9 MB (loaded only
when a photo is read). Neither is precached.

To update: fetch the tarball, check its integrity against the registry, copy
the same files into a new versioned directory, update the paths in
pdf-text.js / ocr.js and VENDOR in sw.js, and regenerate SHA256SUMS:

    cd backend/src/main/resources/static/app/vendor
    find . -type f ! -name SHA256SUMS ! -name SOURCE | sort | sed 's#^\./##' | xargs shasum -a 256 > SHA256SUMS
